<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Tekala debuts at 6.40 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Tekala debuts at 6.40 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Tekala Corp Bhd made its market debut at 6.40 ringgit, against an offer price of 2.60.</p>
<p>The timber company offered 22.5 million shares in its initial public offering for listing on the main board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>Around three minutes into the opening, the stock was at 6.00 ringgit on volume of 1.6 million traded, after trading in a range of 6.00 to 6.50.</p>
<p>The company forecast net earnings per share of 31.47 cents for the year ending march 31, 1997.</p>
<p>At 6.40 ringgit, price-to-earnings ratio is 20.33 times.</p>
</text>
